1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,400
So, in conclusion, here is my candid
advice.

2
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,600
Before you subscribe to any of these
tools, here's something very important.

3
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:11,650
Don't automatically subscribe to these AI
tools, or else you might waste your

4
00:00:11,650 --> 00:00:12,100
money.

5
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:14,800
Instead, choose one or two tools.

6
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:17,600
Use their free credits offer for new
users.

7
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:21,900
Run the same prompt in both AI video tools
and compare the video results.

8
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:25,400
Then ask yourself, which one gives me the
quality I need?

9
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,300
